#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:1 ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:76
msgid "duplexer3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:3
msgid ""
"Like [`duplexer2`](https://github.com/deoxxa/duplexer2) but using "
"Streams3 without readable-stream dependency"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:62
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:64
msgid ""
"This is a reimplementation of "
"[duplexer](https://www.npmjs.com/package/duplexer) using the Streams3 API"
" which is standard in Node as of v4. Everything largely works the same."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:68
msgid "Install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:74
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:78
msgid ""
"Creates a new `DuplexWrapper` object, which is the actual class that "
"implements most of the fun stuff. All that fun stuff is hidden. DON'T "
"LOOK."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:89
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:91
msgid ""
"__options__ - an object specifying the regular `stream.Duplex` options, "
"as   well as the properties described below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:93
msgid "__writable__ - a writable stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:94
msgid "__readable__ - a readable stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:96
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/duplexer3_readme.md:98
msgid ""
"__bubbleErrors__ - a boolean value that specifies whether to bubble "
"errors   from the underlying readable/writable streams. Default is "
"`true`."
msgstr ""

